+# Requirement checklist and verification scope
+
+October30,2026. Local reviewed candidate. This is a bounded TEL02 signal test, not completion of the five-track investigation.
+
+| Requirement | Actual outcome | Limits / locator |
+|---|---|---|
+| Continue real work from last advance | Code and RESULTS | Prior turn made static byte comparison; new turn actually decodes two event/stream pairs and tests signal overlap. No repeated search-miss publication. |
+| Prospective falsifiable method | Native PROTOCOL/polarity addendum; code parameters | Input hashes, search/overlap/windows, polarity, controls and boundaries fixed before signal inspection. Negative/gain/DC controls run before source decoding. |
+| Preserve conflicting fields and original records | README table; SOURCES/RESULTS | Raw source bytes/seek/rate/count fields retained; derived views disclosed, never substituted as originals. Prior hash nonmatches remain. No chosen duration/cause. |
+| Source/provenance and exact coordinates | SOURCES | Official held ZIP, two members, long resource offset26/root stream offsets and hashes; acquisition history separate from this test. Not native call authentication. |
+| Actual scope read/tested | README; all28 windows | No listening/transcription/runtime/voice/call clock/custody check. Overlap-tail and unmatched intervals explicitly retained. No all12-SWF or all-call claim. |
+| Independent controls without overstating independence | RESULTS controls/direct checks | Algorithm sign/numerical controls; same decoder family and reused helper. Not independent historical corroboration or chance probability. |
+| Record actual versions and transformations | Software and command fields | Python3.12.14/NumPy2.3.5/FFmpeg7.1.1 captured in actual invocation; explicit 8kHz derived views, no source seeking/cropping/gain correction. |
+| Reproduction integrity | REPRODUCE; actual local receipt | Compare all non-diagnostic fields, exact hashes/counts/options and1e−9 float tolerance; raw stderr preserved in full logs. No masking numeric disagreement. |
+| Strongest contrary evidence / uncertainty | README interpretation; OPEN-TODOS | High correlations limit byte-difference inference; unmatched Ong tail and nonunity correlation prevent full equivalence/completeness claim. No cause selected. |
+| Full goal/ownership retained | OPEN-TODOS | All five tracks/eighteen substantive criteria unfinished. Technical owner read active on another record route; recorder/materials work not duplicated. |
+| Privacy/preservation/publication | Candidate includes only authored notes/code/numeric hashes | No audio/PCM/waveform arrays/scans/contacts/privatecase data. Source originals untouched; current SSH absence means push TODO, no new publication claim. |
+| Revision accountability | REVISION.diff | Exact first-addition diff for seven substantive candidate files; no existing source/report edited. |
+
+JSON, source/helper/code and companion hashes, candidate/native byte identity, diff validity and actual reproduction must be checked before committing. Structural reproducibility is not authenticity, proof of wrongdoing or a closed substantive criterion. Author/committer verification and any actual public ref/file checks are separate states; no future push is assumed.
