+# Open original inputs and unperformed tests
+
+October30,2026. AUD016-A1 / TC05-B105 / TC06-B110 / TEL02. All five original-record tracks and eighteen substantive criteria remain unfinished; this result advances only a scoped file-signal comparison.
+
+1. Preserve byte-nonidentical event and stream objects and every source field alongside the new high overlap correlations. No cause has been resolved and no preferred original chosen.
+2. Obtain original source recordings, reception/custody/release records, edit/export project files, source-member mappings and the exhibit-preparation chain. Presentation artifacts and filenames do not establish a caller or a complete conversation.
+3. Identify the unmatched Ong event prefix27/tail51,800 analysis samples and Lyles unmatched stream prefix1,185/event tail141. Their content is unexamined. Separate signal-energy/repetition/semantic checks need a concrete scope; no silence, removal or inserted-speech conclusion is adopted.
+4. Actual Flash playback remains unperformed: source SeekSamples, per-block seeking, frame delays, button/actions/envelopes/runtime behavior were not reconstructed. Concatenated MP3 decoding does not prove what a viewer heard. Keep prior static controls and missing authoring/runtime documentation.
+5. Native carrier/operator/recipient event records, field dictionaries, clock configurations, complete Request14 delivery, interview/usage-report originals and caller-to-row/exhibit joins remain required. This Lyles/Ong test does not validate AA77-specific zero-duration semantics or independently reconstruct calls.
+6. FAA corrected QFR/delivery, signed action/no-action, recommendation implementation/closure, applicable policy/classification and actual accession transfer/manifest remain open. Steel and technical-owner recorder/materials dependencies are retained in the adopted plan; no duplicate work is claimed.
+7. Publication: original39b64108 comparison is public, and its independence qualification is in PR8's verified description. Separate b30daf0f qualification files and this new candidate remain local pending working authorization for the existing AveLyra SSH route. Do not repeat unchanged failed pushes, substitute accounts, change credentials or claim a new PR exists. Revisit on a concrete authorization-state change.
+
+Competing possibilities include related signal content in different encodings/preparations, unmatched material, latency/padding and runtime treatments. Strong correlation is not a complete semantic or provenance test; neither a benign export explanation nor deceptive editing is established. A new native record, source-specific manifest or concretely scoped test can change these assessments. No outreach, mailbox, fees, request/filing, media upload, deletion, private push or merge.
